<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40743" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρρίπτ-ω</span></b>  (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπῐρίπτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.128
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Autom.
			</span></i>)), <i>cast at</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτε μοι χαλκήρεα δοῦρα Τρῶες
					ἐπέρριψαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.310
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διώκων ἐ</span>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span>
			<i>throws</i> himself <i>upon</i> his prey, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				629b20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βρούτῳ τὴν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτοῦ φοινικίδα ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρα ἐ.</span>, Lat. <i>manum
				injecit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.84
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphan.
			</span></i>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πλάνας τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					738
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδεῖς αἰτίας ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μέριμναν ἐπὶ
			[θεόν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>; <i>inflict</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰσκληρὰ . .
				ἐπιρριφήσεται</span>, c. dat., Nech.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				7.146
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>apply</i> a plaster or fomentation, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.50
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπάσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.88
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όμενα σκιρρώματα</span>
			<i>spreading over the surface</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>.
				<i>requisition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					5.249
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερεῖα
			τρέφειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				183
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>. metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be imminent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ βραχὺς ἐπέρριπτο κίνδυνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.594
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>throw
				out opinions</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδιορίστως ἐ. περὶ
				τῶν λοιπῶν</span>, v.l. for -, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				986a34
			</span></i>.</div>
